244	// A number on this page is always something to OPEN, so every `#N` the page draws is
245	// an anchor to it. GitHub's `/issues/<n>` redirects to the pull request when the
246	// number is one, so a single form covers both and a sentence naming an issue and the
247	// PR that closes it needs no telling apart.
